<title>BRAZIL: Brazil court overturns CVRD share injunction.</title>
<headline>Brazil court overturns CVRD share injunction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Rio de Janeiro court overturned an injunction suspending the transfer of shares in the May 6 privatisation auction of state mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce, a court official said.</p>
<p>The injunction, issued moments after the hammer fell on the $3.15 billion sale to a consortium led by Brazil steelmaker CSN, was overturned by 10 votes to five, he added.</p>
<p>The government is due to transfer the 41.73 percent of voting CVRD share capital to the new owners on Friday.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
